      "message": "This scan is what makes conversion O(variables × live slots): each variable that needs a slot looks from slot 1 up. With P variables live at once, such as a join\u0027s parameters or long-lived lets, that\u0027s P²/2 checks. A free-slot structure would make it O(log n) per variable: a `BTreeSet` of free slots, or a min-heap with lazy deletion keyed by when each slot frees.",
